          "verdict": "issue",
          "quote": "**Completely** goes before an adjective (*completely wrong*) or before the main verb (*I completely forgot*).",
          "severity": "blocking",
          "family": "adaptation",
          "reason": "This gives an incomplete and potentially misleading placement rule: completely can also modify adverbs and can occur after a linking verb, as in “The room is completely empty.”"
